Assignment source: input/hw_questions.md (plain markdown, 41 lines, no figures).
Supporting data: input/PaperList.xlsx -> ingest/csv/PaperList.csv + 6 rendered pages.

Three-channel read (R7):
  - hw_questions.md is a text_document; ingest produced no PNGs for it (kind=text_document,
